<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-group {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .label {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px; /* Adjust as needed for alignment */
    font-weight: normal;
  }
  .value {
    display: inline-block;
    width: calc(100% - 160px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .divider {
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    margin: 20px 0;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1>In-Country Safety Information Form</h1>
  <p>University of <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span>: International Academic Programs</p>
  <p>Two weeks prior to departure email to International Academic Programs: <a href="http://international@example.com">{{ international_email }}</a></p>

  <div class="section-title">Campus or Program Security Abroad (as applicable):</div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Name:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Address:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Phone number:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Hours:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="hours">{{ hours }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Website:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="website">{{ website }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">911 Equivalent in Relevant Countries:</div>
  <p>Typically can be found in Department of State Country Specific Information page under Victims of Crime <a href="http://travel.state.gov/content/passports/english/country.html">{{ travel_link_911 }}</a></p>

  <div class="section-title">Local Police Phone Number in Relevant Cities:</div>
  <p>
    <span class="value" style="width: 100%; border: none;">
      <span data-field="local_police_number_1">{{ local_police_number_1 }}</span> / 
      <span data-field="local_police_number_2">{{ local_police_number_2 }}</span> / 
      <span data-field="local_police_number_3">{{ local_police_number_3 }}</span>
    </span>
  </p>

  <div class="section-title">Closest Consulate Office(s) in each location:</div>
  <p>Typically can be found in Department of State Country Specific Information page <a href="http://travel.state.gov/content/passports/english/country.html">{{ travel_link_consulate }}</a></p>

  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Name:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="consulate_name">{{ consulate_name }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Address:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="consulate_address">{{ consulate_address }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Phone number:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="consulate_phone">{{ consulate_phone }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Hours:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="consulate_hours">{{ consulate_hours }}</span></span>
  </div>
  <div class="form-group">
    <span class="label">Website:</span>
    <span class="value"><span data-field="consulate_website">{{ consulate_website }}</span></span>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <div class="section-title">U.S. Department of State Smart Traveler Enrollment Program (STEP):</div>
  <p>Register yourself and remind all participants to enroll in STEP <a href="https://step.state.gov/step/">{{ step_enrollment_link }}</a></p>
  <p>Things to cover with participants during program specific pre-departure and/or at the onsite orientation which you will provide: special information about areas of town, transportation, pickpockets and other crime possibilities, areas to avoid, <a href="#">predetermined emergency meeting location #1</a> and <a href="#">emergency meeting location #2</a> (in case of a serious emergency), how they can contact you in an emergency, etc.</p>

  <div class="section-title">NOTES:</div>
  <div style="height: 200px; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 5px;">
    <!-- Placeholder for notes -->
  </div>

</div>